# Reviewers for the shared CI source of truth.
#
# Path-scoped rather than a catch-all, so the entries say which areas are
# owned. The earlier reason given here -- that a catch-all might leak to other
# repositories through default community health files -- was unfounded:
# CODEOWNERS is not in that set, and ownership does not cross repository
# boundaries. Adding a catch-all here would be safe; it is left out because
# the paths below already cover everything this repository ships.
#
# The last matching pattern wins, so anything more specific goes below.
.github/workflows/ @sebastient
.github/actions/ @sebastient
.github/scripts/ @sebastient
.github/rulesets/ @sebastient
.github/runners/ @sebastient
.github/copilot-instructions.md @sebastient
templates/ @sebastient
